<title>USA: American Technology, Carver team.</title>
<headline>American Technology, Carver team.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Technology Corp and Carver Corp said Tuesday they have entered into an agreement to collaborate on the development of a home audio sound system.</p>
<p>The accord anticipates a formal license agreement between the two companies. The proposed sound system would use customized Carver high-fidelity audio components and American Technology's HyperSonic Sound reproduction technology.</p>
<p>HyperSonic Sound is a new method of audio reproduction whereby sound is generated directly in mid-air without the use of loudspeakers.</p>
</text>
